    ("Cambodia" :region "southeast-asia" :globe "Southeast Asia" :lewis "multi-active" :meyer (85 82 85 80 88 85 85 50) :hofstede (72 18 35 55 48 38) :highlights ("Gentle, formal, hierarchy-centered: Samdech/Achar titles honored; elders and monks greeted first, with a sompeah if expected." "Harmony over candor: indirect refusals; use a well-connected Khmer intermediary to learn the true position." "Patron-client networks decide; patience and modest gifts of respect (not inducements) sustain relationships.") :extrapolated t)
