    ("Nigeria" :region "subsaharan-africa" :globe "Sub-Saharan Africa" :lewis "multi-active" :meyer (80 72 80 82 85 75 85 55) :hofstede (80 30 60 55 13 84) :highlights ("Greeting ritual is the meeting: ask about family, health, journey -- cutting it kills the deal." "Titles, rank and age rule: address Doctor/Chief/Engineer properly; elders speak first." "Relationship and community networks decide; the formal org chart is a shadow of the real one." "Flexible time ('African time'), loud expressive debate, warm persistence -- but confirm, confirm, confirm in writing." "Generosity signals seriousness: hosting and gifts (modest, culturally apt) are read as respect."))
